{
  "name": "accordion",
  "title": "折叠面板",
  "titleEn": "Accordion",
  "category": "data",
  "summary": "基于原生 <details> 的折叠面板，带编号徽章与旋转箭头；加 JS 后展开收起有平滑动画。",
  "when": "把长内容分组收起，如章节分幕、常见问题。只需单个「展开更多」也可以用一个 __item。",
  "root": "riko-accordion",
  "element": "div",
  "parts": [
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion__item",
      "desc": "一项（必须是 <details>）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion__summary",
      "desc": "标题行（必须是 <summary>）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion__badge",
      "desc": "左侧编号徽章（展开时变橙并微旋）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion__title",
      "desc": "标题文字"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion__meta",
      "desc": "右侧小计数（如「3 节」）"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion__content",
      "desc": "展开的内容"
    }
  ],
  "modifiers": [
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion--exclusive",
      "desc": "同一时间只展开一项",
      "group": "behavior"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion--cards",
      "desc": "每项是独立卡片",
      "group": "layout"
    },
    {
      "class": "riko-accordion--flush",
      "desc": "无外框，嵌入其他容器",
      "group": "layout"
    }
  ],
  "states": [
    {
      "attr": "open",
      "on": "riko-accordion__item",
      "desc": "原生属性：默认展开"
    }
  ],
  "js": {
    "attr": "data-riko=\"accordion\"",
    "methods": [
      {
        "signature": "el.riko.open(i) / close(i) / toggle(i)",
        "desc": "i 为序号或 details 元素"
      }
    ],
    "events": [
      {
        "name": "riko:accordion:toggle",
        "detail": "{ item, open }",
        "desc": "展开或收起时"
      }
    ]
  },
  "a11y": [
    "使用原生 <details>/<summary>，键盘（Enter/空格）与读屏开箱即用。",
    "__badge 中只放简短编号；需要的话给它 aria-hidden=\"true\"。"
  ],
  "rules": [
    "不加 data-riko 也能用（无动画或使用浏览器原生动画）。",
    "--exclusive 需要 JS；不用 JS 时可以给每个 details 写相同的 name 属性实现互斥。"
  ],
  "avoid": [
    "不要用 <div> 代替 <details>/<summary>。",
    "不要在 summary 里放链接或按钮。"
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "分幕目录",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-accordion\" data-riko=\"accordion\" style=\"max-width: 560px\">\n  <details class=\"riko-accordion__item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"riko-accordion__summary\">\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__badge\" aria-hidden=\"true\">一</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__title\">序章 · 第一幕：沙滩上的画家</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__meta\">3 节</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"riko-accordion__content\">001 沙滩上的画家 · 002 世界的边缘 · 003 熟悉的身影</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"riko-accordion__item\">\n    <summary class=\"riko-accordion__summary\">\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__badge\" aria-hidden=\"true\">二</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__title\">序章 · 第二幕：归途的微光</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__meta\">5 节</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"riko-accordion__content\">004 变故 · 005 Star 的决心 · 006 重逢 · 007 村庄 · 008 归途的微光</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"riko-accordion__item\">\n    <summary class=\"riko-accordion__summary\">\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__badge\" aria-hidden=\"true\">三</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__title\">序章 · 第三幕：暗林深处</span>\n      <span class=\"riko-accordion__meta\">6 节</span>\n    </summary>\n    <div class=\"riko-accordion__content\">009 暗林 · 010 不幸 · 011 禁忌的力量 · 012 逃离袭击 · 013 谈判 · 014 命令方块</div>\n  </details>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "title": "卡片式 · 互斥展开",
      "html": "<div class=\"riko-accordion riko-accordion--cards riko-accordion--exclusive\" data-riko=\"accordion\" style=\"max-width: 560px\">\n  <details class=\"riko-accordion__item\" open>\n    <summary class=\"riko-accordion__summary\"><span class=\"riko-accordion__title\">小说多久更新一次？</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"riko-accordion__content\">作者星星酥会尽量保持每周更新，预计 2027 年继续更新新的章节！</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"riko-accordion__item\">\n    <summary class=\"riko-accordion__summary\"><span class=\"riko-accordion__title\">笔记本会剧透吗？</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"riko-accordion__content\">笔记本只整理已出现的设定，但还是建议先读完已更新的章节哦。</div>\n  </details>\n  <details class=\"riko-accordion__item\">\n    <summary class=\"riko-accordion__summary\"><span class=\"riko-accordion__title\">在哪里反馈错别字？</span></summary>\n    <div class=\"riko-accordion__content\">页面底部的「反馈」表单就可以，谢谢你帮络可捉虫！</div>\n  </details>\n</div>"
    }
  ],
  "requires": [
    {
      "selector": ".riko-accordion__item",
      "message": "riko-accordion__item 必须是 <details> 元素",
      "tag": "details"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-accordion__summary",
      "message": "riko-accordion__summary 必须是 <summary> 元素",
      "tag": "summary"
    },
    {
      "selector": ".riko-accordion__item",
      "parent": ".riko-accordion",
      "message": "riko-accordion__item 必须位于 riko-accordion 之内"
    }
  ],
  "related": [
    "tree",
    "sidenav"
  ]
}